              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "iūdicium, iūdiciī — \"a trial; a judgement\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Iūdicium in basilicā habitum est. The trial was held in the basilica."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter, 2nd declension. Both the trial and the verdict at its end; also 'opinion': meō iūdiciō, in my judgement."
            }
          ]
        },
