          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "iūdicium is built on iūdex, \"judge\" (EtymDB): what a judge does, the trial and its verdict. English judicial belongs to the same family."
