              "text": "Senātus eum hostem iūdicāvit. The senate declared him a public enemy."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "iūdicō, iūdicāre, iūdicāvī, iūdicātum, often with two accusatives: someone + what he is judged to be."
